[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1051","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44098","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC 远程命令注入漏洞","description":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 电动汽车充电控制器固件存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者在能够控制 OCPP 后端并绕过防火墙限制的前提下，可通过特制请求向设备注入恶意系统命令，以有限用户 charx-oa 身份执行任意操作系统命令，导致充电服务中断。该漏洞影响固件版本低于 1.9.1 的 CHARX SEC-3150，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44098"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:31:21Z","remediation":"立即将受影响的 CHARX SEC-3000、SEC-3050、SEC-3100 及 SEC-3150 充电控制器固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本。升级操作：登录设备 Web 管理界面，进入系统维护→固件更新页面，上传 Phoenix Contact 官方发布的 1.9.1 固件包并确认安装，完成后重启设备并验证版本号。若暂无法立即升级，应在网络边界防火墙中限制 OCPP 后端对设备端口的访问，仅放行受信任的充电管理服务器 IP，同时关闭不必要的 Modbus TCP 服务端口以缩小攻击面。Phoenix Contact 已在安全公告 VDE-2026-008 中确认修复固件最迟于 2026 年 8 月 12 日前在官网产品下载页面发布。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44098.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44098/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44098.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44098/README_KO.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d9ab8c47e3a5a772fad5188fe6b3e1410be779f2/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-44098/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1048","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44097","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3xxx 系列电动汽车充电控制器存在未限制文件上传漏洞（CWE-434）。具有\"operator\"权限的低权限远程攻击者可通过本意为固件更新的 REST 接口上传任意文件，导致攻击者控制的文件被持久化存储在设备上，并可能耗尽系统资源，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 CHARX SEC-3xxx 系列设备，该产品专为封闭工业网络设计，通常部署在站点级防火墙后方。攻击者需要通过网络访问目标设备的 REST 固件更新服务，并已获得 operator 权限认证，无需额外用户交互即可利用。根据 CISA 评估，该漏洞暂无在野利用证据，技术影响程度为局部，且不可自动化利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44097"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:17:11Z","remediation":"建议将 CHARX SEC-3000、SEC-3050、SEC-3100、SEC-3150 充电控制器固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本，该补丁计划于 2026 年 8 月 12 日前在 Phoenix Contact 官网产品页面发布。如暂时无法升级，应将这些设备部署在封闭工业网络中，并通过防火墙严格限制对 REST 固件更新端点的访问，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 发起请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3cd9ba427c33ce366db05d18df45d3a792f5f74/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44097.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44097.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44097.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2026-44097.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2026/CVE-2026-44097.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1045","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44096","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC 命令注入权限提升漏洞","description":"udhcpc 存在权限提升漏洞，由于在处理 DHCP 客户端交互时对输入验证不当，本地低权限用户 charx-web 可通过触发该漏洞在系统上以 root 身份执行任意操作系统命令，最终导致完全系统沦陷。该漏洞影响使用 udhcpc 作为 DHCP 客户端的嵌入式 Linux 系统及路由器等设备。攻击者需具备本地访问权限并登录为 charx-web 用户，通过利用命令注入机制即可获取 root 权限并完全控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44096"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:23Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3000/3050/3100/3150 充电控制器固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本。可通过设备 Web 管理界面或 Phoenix Contact 官方固件更新工具进行升级。升级前请备份配置，升级后验证固件版本显示为 1.9.1+。若暂时无法升级，可作为临时缓解措施限制本地 \"charx-web\" 用户权限，或在网络层面隔离设备管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44096.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44096.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2026/CVE-2026-44096.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2026-44096.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1043","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44095","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC 系列网络配置脚本命令注入漏洞","description":"网络配置脚本存在权限提升漏洞（CWE-78），低权限本地用户可通过该脚本执行任意系统命令并获取 root 权限，导致完全系统沦陷。攻击者需在目标系统上拥有低权限账户登录权限，利用该脚本的输入验证缺陷注入恶意命令，从而绕过权限限制以 root 身份执行任意操作。该漏洞影响使用该网络配置脚本的系统，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。攻击成功后可导致攻击者完全控制目标系统，窃取敏感数据或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44095"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:31:21Z","remediation":"Phoenix Contact 已发布固件版本 1.9.1 修复此漏洞，受影响设备应立即升级至该版本。升级前请确保设备处于受保护的工业内网中，并通过防火墙严格限制外部对设备管理端口的访问。若无法立即完成固件升级，应暂时限制对设备的本地物理和 SSH 访问权限，仅允许授权管理员登录，以降低低权限本地用户利用网络配置脚本注入系统命令提权至 root 的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44095.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44095.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2026/CVE-2026-44095.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2026-44095.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1040","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44094","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3000/3050/3100/3150 充电控制器固件分区回退默认凭据绕过漏洞","description":"tags.<value>未经身份认证的远程攻击者可强制目标系统回退到包含不安全配置的固件分区，该分区内保留有默认凭据。利用此漏洞，攻击者能够以未授权用户 \"user-app\" 的身份通过 SSH 远程登录系统，并可能中断设备的充电进程。该漏洞源于固件分区切换时的设计缺陷（CWE-636），攻击者无需任何凭据即可远程触发，影响运行受影响固件版本的 Phoenix Contact CHARX 充电控制器。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44094"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T15:16:33Z","remediation":"建议将受影响的 Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3000、SEC-3050、SEC-3100、SEC-3150 充电控制器固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本，该补丁计划于 2026 年 8 月 12 日前在 Phoenix Contact 产品网页下载区发布。将设备部署在封闭工业网络内，并通过防火墙阻止外部对 SSH（22 端口）、Modbus TCP 及管理端口的访问，仅允许授权后端 IP 进行 OCPP 通信。若无法立即升级，应在网络边界禁用 SSH 访问并修改默认凭据作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f0157eb1d3b7a8fabc66703c974f4c55304d1fa1/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44094.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44094/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44094.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44094/README_KO.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44094.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1038","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44093","title":"操作系统 初始化脚本 命令执行漏洞","description":"用户应用程序初始化脚本存在命令注入漏洞，低权限本地用户可通过构造特制的输入参数在系统启动时注入恶意操作系统命令，以 root 身份执行任意代码，从而获取系统完全控制权。该漏洞影响使用受影响初始化脚本管理的用户应用程序所在主机，攻击者需拥有目标系统的本地低权限访问权限即可利用，无需额外身份认证或用户交互。成功利用后，攻击者可完全接管目标系统，读取敏感数据、修改系统配置或进一步横向移动。CWE-78 类型漏洞，CVSS v4.0 评分 8.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44093"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:31:21Z","remediation":"将 CHARX SEC-3000/3050/3100/3150 设备的固件升级至 v1.9.1 或更高版本，该修复版本由 Phoenix Contact 于 2026 年 8 月 12 日前发布，可通过厂商官方支持渠道获取。如无法立即升级，应临时限制低权限本地用户对 user-applications 服务的访问权限，并在文件系统中禁用不必要用户的符号链接创建能力（例如通过设置 /etc/sysctl.conf 中的 fs.protected_symlinks=1），同时限制本地 SSH/Telnet 等远程登录入口以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44093.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44093.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/3c4d7392fa5965a157cd052f4789036ef0f7ddd6/api/2026/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2026-44093.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce2c8661ffd3fb6a28ed59c3d877961640a570d4/2026/CVE-2026-44093.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/JSON/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44093.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1036","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1036.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44092","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 ModbusServer 未验证输入注入漏洞","description":"ModbusServer 应用程序在从 MQTT 消息中间件获取数据时未对输入进行充分校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 MQTT 代理发布特制恶意消息，利用该注入漏洞向 ModbusServer 传输恶意载荷，从而破坏系统数据完整性和服务可用性。该漏洞影响所有运行存在缺陷版本的 ModbusServer 系统，攻击者无需任何身份凭据或用户交互，只需网络可达即可发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，危害等级高，CVSS 评分 8.8。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44092"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:57Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:17:11Z","remediation":"立即将受影响设备固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本。受影响型号包括 CHARX SEC-3000、SEC-3050、SEC-3100 和 SEC-3150，固件版本低于 FW 1.9.1 均受影响。升级步骤：登录设备管理界面查看当前固件版本，从 Phoenix Contact 官方支持页面下载对应型号的 V1.9.1 固件包，通过 Web 界面或 TFTP 上传并完成升级。如暂时无法立即升级，应在防火墙规则中严格限制 ModbusServer 服务端口和 MQTT 端口的访问来源，仅允许来自受信任管理网段的 IP 连接，以阻断未授权远程攻击者向 ModbusServer 注入恶意输入的路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c67c7954c46b752d4b167913e3e046ed998744d0/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44092.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44092/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44092.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44092/README_KO.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/a0b0997e025982b6ed5bd32499f8742032e17637/content/posts/cve-2026-44092.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1036.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1034","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44091","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 MQTT Broker 未授权配置篡改漏洞","description":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 电动汽车充电控制器固件中存在信任边界违规漏洞（CWE-501）。该设备的 MQTT Broker 服务未对客户端进行身份认证和输入验证，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向 MQTT Broker 发送特制的恶意 ID 请求，导致系统在配置中创建新的配置条目。攻击者可借此篡改设备配置参数，造成完整性破坏和服务中断（可用性丧失）。该漏洞影响 CHARX SEC-3150 固件 1.9.1 以下版本。尽管该设备设计用于封闭工业网络且通常部署在防火墙后方，但一旦 MQTT Broker 暴露于网络可达范围内，攻击者即可在无需任何凭据和用户交互的情况下完成利用。Phoenix Contact 已发布固件版本 1.9.1 修复此漏洞，建议用户升级并确保设备部署在受保护的内部网络中。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44091"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-31T23:17:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3xxx 系列 EV 充电控制器的固件升级至 1.9.1 或更高版本，升级文件可从 Phoenix Contact 官网或 CERT VDE 公告 VDE-2026-008 获取。如暂时无法升级，应在网络边界部署防火墙规则，仅允许可信管理主机访问 MQTT Broker 端口，并将设备限制在封闭工业网络内。升级完成后，需检查系统配置中是否存在恶意 ID 条目并清除，同时审计所有配置变更记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44091.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44091/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44091.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44091/README_KO.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-44091.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-1034.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1031","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44090","title":"Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3150 MQTT broker 身份验证缺失漏洞","description":"MQTT broker 存在身份认证缺失漏洞（CWE-306），该服务仅依赖防火墙限制外部访问而未实施身份验证机制。未经身份认证的远程攻击者若能访问 MQTT broker（例如绕过防火墙规则或从内部网络发起连接），即可直接连接并操控 broker，进而完全接管目标设备，造成数据泄露、设备被控等严重后果。该漏洞影响依赖 MQTT 通信的物联网设备及工业控制系统，CVSS v4.0 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44090"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-30T07:16:56Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:31:21Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Phoenix Contact CHARX SEC-3000/3050/3100/3150 充电控制器固件升级至 1.9.1 版本（2026年8月12日前发布）。升级前请从官网下载区获取对应型号固件包。如无法立即升级，必须将设备部署在封闭工业网络内，并在边界防火墙严格限制 MQTT 端口（默认 1883/8883）仅允许受信 IP 访问，同时禁用不必要的远程管理服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.certvde.com/en/advisories/VDE-2026-008/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/71e7ec7831487791fa2712228e5e13057adec23c/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/45fe7fc1a2f9ac2222fd28b77156af622e92fde8/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/fdd3cf49156dc683c87ad86ac7e4c8f79b9d99df/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-07-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44090.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44090/README.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-440xx/CVE-2026-44090.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-44090/README_KO.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4de02d857778e2a09d389d9fc3f2041a10677e37/content/posts/cve-2026-44090.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0970","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0970.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67439","title":"OliveTin OliveTin 同步执行接口日志权限绕过漏洞","description":"OliveTin 是一个通过 Web 界面安全访问预定义 shell 命令的开源工具。其同步执行接口 StartActionAndWait 和 StartActionByGetAndWait 在返回执行结果的完整 LogEntry 输出时，未校验用户的 logs 权限。OliveTin 的 ACL 模型将 exec（执行）与 logs（日志查看）权限分离，允许管理员配置用户可执行操作但禁止查看输出。然而上述两个端点直接返回包含命令输出的 LogEntry 对象，导致仅拥有 exec 权限而 logs 权限被设为 false 的用户仍可读取操作输出，造成权限绕过。攻击者可通过发送特制的 API 请求利用此漏洞获取本应受限的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 3000.17.0 之前的所有版本，已在 3000.17.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67439","GHSA-jm28-2wcr-qf3h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T21:17:48Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:21:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 OliveTin 至 3000.17.0 或更高版本（https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0），该版本在 StartActionAndWait 和 StartActionByGetAndWait 端点中强制实施了 logs 权限检查。如无法立即升级，可临时移除低权限用户的 exec 权限，或通过反向代理规则拦截对 /api/StartActionAndWait 和 /api/StartActionByGetAndWait 的访问作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/commit/e421780c9885aa5024d2f47b4ed4898f2f18eb90","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/security/advisories/GHSA-jm28-2wcr-qf3h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-67439.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/CVE-2026-67439.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b4c640370a6a34ea36c82cbaea3c29d7c103902a/content/posts/cve-2026-67439.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0970.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0969","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0969.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67438","title":"OliveTin 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"OliveTin 是一款用于执行预配置 Shell 命令的开源 Web 管理界面。其 `checkShellArgumentSafety()` 函数维护了一个不安全的参数类型黑名单，但未将 `regex:` 前缀的自定义参数类型纳入其中。当 Shell 模式动作使用 `regex:` 类型参数时，该参数会绕过安全检查，其值通过 Go 的 `text/template` 直接拼接至 `sh -c` 命令字符串中且未经转义，导致 OS 命令注入。即使管理员设置了看似严格的正则表达式（如 `^[^;|&<>]+$`），攻击者仍可通过 POSIX 命令替换语法（如 `$(command)`）绕过限制。未认证的远程攻击者仅需网络访问即可在 OliveTin 进程用户权限下执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 OliveTin 3000.2.0 至 3000.17.0 版本，已在 3000.17.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67438","GHSA-xc5w-4v5w-7x65"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T21:17:48Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:21:23Z","remediation":"立即升级至 OliveTin 3000.17.0 或更高版本。如使用 Docker 部署，执行 `docker pull ghcr.io/olivetin/olivetin:3000.17.0` 并重启容器。如使用二进制部署，从 https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0 下载最新版本替换。临时缓解措施：在反向代理层限制对 `/api/v1/StartAction` 端点的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 调用；同时审查所有 Shell 模式 action 配置，避免使用 `regex:` 前缀的自定义参数类型。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/commit/995ff79736f2bccc364448a3ece84087b550b232","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/security/advisories/GHSA-xc5w-4v5w-7x65","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67438.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-67438.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/CVE-2026-67438.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0969.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0969.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0969.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0967","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0967.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67437","title":"OliveTin OAuth2 状态内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OliveTin 的 OAuth2 登录处理器在 `/oauth/login` 请求时将每次登录状态存储到内存中的 `registeredStates` 映射中，该映射无限制增长且从未设置过期时间、删除机制或大小上限。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标 OliveTin 实例发送大量 `/oauth/login` 请求，持续创建新的状态条目，导致服务器内存被逐渐耗尽，最终引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有启用了 OAuth2 的 OliveTin 版本（3000.0.0 至 3000.17.0 之前），与 CVE-2026-28789（并发 map 写入崩溃）不同，即使应用了互斥锁修复后该内存耗尽问题仍然存在，需重启服务才能恢复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67437","GHSA-xpxj-f2fm-rqch"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T21:17:47Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:21:23Z","remediation":"立即升级 OliveTin 至 3000.17.0 或以上版本（https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0），该版本已修复 OAuth2 状态表无限制增长问题。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 OAuth2 认证方式，改用本地认证或 IP 白名单限制 /oauth/login 端点的外部访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/commit/ec114e95d297b806c3ca0c37bc139b3c9c517b3f","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/releases/tag/3000.17.0","https://github.com/OliveTin/OliveTin/security/advisories/GHSA-xpxj-f2fm-rqch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67437.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-67437.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_3_CVE-2026-67437.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0967.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0965","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0965.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67435","title":"Linuxfabrik lib 跨源重定向凭证泄露漏洞","description":"tags asrequested.<value>linuxfabrik-lib 是一个提供数据库访问、缓存、Shell 执行和 API 集成等功能的 Python 模块库。其 lib.url.fetch() 函数在跟随 HTTP 重定向时，仅由 httpx 库自动剥离 Authorization 和 Cookie 头，但其他调用方提供的认证头（如 Redfish 的 X-Auth-Token、API 密钥等）会在跨源重定向时被转发到目标服务器。恶意或可被重定向的服务器可通过返回 3xx 响应，将认证请求重定向到攻击者控制的主机，从而窃取认证凭证，导致服务端请求伪造和令牌泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用非标准认证头进行身份验证的插件，CVSS 评分 6.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67435","GHSA-4jc5-g844-4x33"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:27:23Z","remediation":"立即将 linuxfabrik-lib 升级至 6.0.0 或更高版本（commit 6573ff9），该版本在跨源重定向时自动丢弃所有调用方提供的凭据头。如无法升级，可在调用 fetch() 时设置 follow_redirects=False 禁用重定向跟随，或在应用层手动清除 X-Auth-Token 等非标准认证头后再发起请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Linuxfabrik/lib/commit/6573ff9347e541200305d278d2663d2e54e052ff","https://github.com/Linuxfabrik/lib/releases/tag/v6.0.0","https://github.com/Linuxfabrik/monitoring-plugins/security/advisories/GHSA-4jc5-g844-4x33","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/linuxfabrik-lib/CVE-2026-67435.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3325b9a058340dae0cf4a308bd7383225ee5322b/content/posts/cve-2026-67435.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/967da9d6d460202310d5ea881594506ef29aa587/2026/CVE-2026-67435.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/f785f3444159263c9afde232b5456d1f01686673/api/2026/CVE-2026-67435.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0965.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0963","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0963.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67432","title":"MCP Ruby SDK StreamableHTTPTransport 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>MCP Ruby SDK 的 StreamableHTTPTransport 组件在处理 JSON-RPC POST 请求时，未对 HTTP 请求体大小进行任何限制，直接将完整请求体读入内存并使用 `JSON.parse` 解析。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送超大体积的 JSON-RPC POST 请求触发该漏洞，导致进程内存被耗尽而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 `MCP::Server::Transports::StreamableHTTPTransport` 的部署，无论是否启用状态模式均受影响，且无需会话令牌或凭据。攻击者仅需发送一个精心构造的超大请求即可使工作进程内存激增，在多租户环境中可导致服务不可用。该问题已在 mcp gem 0.23.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67432","GHSA-h669-8m4g-r2hc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:30:33Z","remediation":"升级 mcp gem 至 0.23.0 或更高版本，该版本对 StreamableHTTPTransport 的 handle_post 方法增加了请求体大小限制并在 JSON.parse 前进行 Content-Length 检查，同时为 stdio_transport.rb 的 $stdin.gets 添加了 limit 参数。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）设置 client_max_body_size 4m 以拦截超大请求体，或通过防火墙限制单连接速率作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/772e0cb1f9db69312006926eee59a7287ad50166","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/releases/tag/v0.23.0","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-h669-8m4g-r2hc","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/1fe38c32f136c99453f4b0912eefa3da079988c2/gems/mcp/CVE-2026-67432.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67432.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1d36f3e9bfc6430c5bcee0e6bd4df5788a4946f1/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67432.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-07-07-CVE-2026-67432.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67432.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67432.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67432.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/828bc0c3d151d823031bb5f4967fccfb52da9ec4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-67432.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67432.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67432.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0963.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0963.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0963.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0960","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0960.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67431","title":"MCP Ruby SDK 会话会话中毒漏洞","description":"MCP Ruby SDK 的 StreamableHTTP 传输实现中存在会话所有权验证缺失漏洞。攻击者通过窃取有效的会话 ID，无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送工具调用请求，服务器未验证会话 ID 与请求者的绑定关系，直接执行恶意工具调用并将响应注入受害者的 SSE 流中。该漏洞影响使用 Ruby MCP SDK 0.23.0 之前版本的服务端应用，攻击者可在受害者不知情的情况下执行未授权操作，属于静默会话劫持攻击。官方已在 v0.23.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67431","GHSA-5p9g-j988-pcwv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:30:33Z","remediation":"立即将 mcp gem 升级至 0.23.0 或以上版本（`gem update mcp`），该版本已实现会话 ID 与用户身份的绑定验证。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对每个会话绑定用户认证信息（如 JWT token），并在处理 POST /messages/:session_id 请求时校验会话所有者身份，拒绝未授权会话的 tool call 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/35466605319a34e4c7808712ae9bb1ca1afb2356","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/releases/tag/v0.23.0","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-5p9g-j988-pcwv","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/1fe38c32f136c99453f4b0912eefa3da079988c2/gems/mcp/CVE-2026-67431.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67431.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67431.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-07-07-CVE-2026-67431.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67431.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67431.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/828bc0c3d151d823031bb5f4967fccfb52da9ec4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-67431.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67431.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67431.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67431.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0960.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0960.toml"}]